      "side": 1,
      "message": "This code is related to https://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/u/2/issues/414507692?pli\u003d1.\n\nWe believe that NetworkWatchlistService reporting during the boot phase is inappropriate and will slow down other system services. Therefore, we have decided to postpone it until 1 minute later. We assume that the system is still in the boot phase within 30 seconds. If NetworkWatchlistService reports during this phase, we will postpone it by 1 minute. If there is a better optimization method, I hope reviewers can also provide it, thank you.\n\nThe test steps are as follows:\n1.Install 60 APKs; All Logs, Data filled to 95%;\n2.Close watchdog, open Sysdump;\n3.Repeated restart for a long time (120h)",
